DSRACE-2[code]: Only the run whose concurrent claim note is first (by created_at, then id) returns {"acquired": true}; all others return {"acquired": false} covers: RQTIE-2, RQTIE-1 [FIX IN TEST: none of the three parts — Given, When, or Then — has a heading comment; the section has only a banner line comment and inline data-setup comments — ACCEPTED IF: comments marking Given, When, and Then each over their own code]
  Given: two or more concurrent claim notes exist for the same issue within the detection window
  When: each run compares the notes and identifies the first
  Then: the run whose note has the earliest created_at returns {"acquired": true}
  And: all other runs return {"acquired": false, "holder": "<winner_holder>", "race_lost": true}
